@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Agent harness integration
+
+NUI uses one canonical graph and thin host adapters. Codex/Antigravity-compatible discovery uses `.agents/skills/nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; Claude Code uses `.claude/skills/nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; other hosts can use `scripts/nui-agent-export`, project instructions, or MCP. An adapter translates discovery only. It must not duplicate canonical skill bodies, raise design authority, or infer permissions.
+
+Before relying on a host capability, verify its current primary-source documentation. If the host cannot browse, inspect renders, generate images, or write to a design canvas, record the missing evidence and route that step to a capable host/human rather than certifying it.
