@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# CLI integration
+
+Use `python scripts/nui-agent-export --agent <id>` to obtain a host-specific discovery plan and `python scripts/nui-media-query` to inspect the rights-aware media registry. These commands emit plans/data; they do not silently download assets, execute third-party skills, or grant capabilities. A calling agent performs live research with its own permitted tools and records provenance before adoption.
