@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# MCP integration
+
+`python scripts/nui-mcp-server` exposes bounded local read/analysis tools: NUI status, one canonical skill, host install plans, media-source registry, creative-tool registry, and tool-learning sources. It intentionally exposes no arbitrary shell executor, generic URL fetcher, skill auto-installer, or project writer. MCP is a transport surface; the host remains the permission authority and NUI source/skill/media policies remain unchanged.
