+# Visual media workflow
+
+NUI distinguishes geometry from **shape substitution**. Geometry is valid when it structures, controls, encodes or deliberately composes. A generic orb/blob/fake network is rejected when it occupies a semantic slot that should contain subject-native evidence or a truthful representation.
+
+Workflow: map semantic media opportunities → query appropriate source classes → verify each asset at its origin → record creator/rights/transformations → author a custom asset only when needed → integrate in responsive/temporal states → verify crop, hierarchy, accessibility, performance and provenance-to-render lineage. Search providers are discovery surfaces, never blanket rights certificates.
